<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Int'l Network started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Int'l Network started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Co said on Tuesday it had started its coverage of International Network Services with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- An analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock was off 1/4 to 37-1/4 in early trading.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
